{"id":"n31752-1-10","stage":3,"title":"정상 · 正常","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31752-1-10-1","ko":"오늘이 추석인데 문을 연 식당이 있으려나?","zh":"今天是中秋节，会有开门的餐厅吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘이","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘이","audio":"/audio/c4a432f0e61abb21e6b8.mp3"}},{"text":"추석인데","meaning":"中秋节","explanation":"추석：中秋节；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"추석","audio":"/audio/186bf2f255c7c8f2273c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69061","senseId":"1","lemma":"추석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추석인데","audio":"/audio/aab3e94dc7ec177491a4.mp3"}},{"text":"문을","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문을","audio":"/audio/e9d89a0e3afa5573f056.mp3"}},{"text":"연","meaning":"开张，开门","explanation":"열다：开张，开门；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"3","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연","audio":"/audio/bda2e47c418666075e2f.mp3"}},{"text":"식당이","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당이","audio":"/audio/7fb3ef89763c2688893b.mp3"}},{"text":"있으려나?","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；으려나：对未来或可能发生的情况自问、推测，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으려나","audio":"/audio/b6cdf8f02e32ed2024dc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"186bf2f255c7c8f2","term":"추석","zh":"中秋节","audio":"/audio/186bf2f255c7c8f2273c.mp3","entryId":"69061","definition":"韩国的节日之一。农历8月15日，人们准备用新米做的松糕及当季水果进行祭祀。并且举行摔跤、拔河、圆圈舞等民俗游戏。","pronunciation":["추석"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开张，开门","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"开始一天的营业。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/33e1dcad1016ba2465b9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31752-1-10-2","ko":"명절에도 평소처럼 정상 영업을 하는 식당이 하나 있어. 거기 가자.","zh":"有个餐厅即使在节日期间也像平时一样正常营业。我们去那儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"명절에도","meaning":"节日","explanation":"명절：节日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절에도","audio":"/audio/ca2938bd567768df0842.mp3"}},{"text":"평소처럼","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평소처럼","audio":"/audio/0693587dfb5844ba7931.mp3"}},{"text":"정상","meaning":"正常","explanation":"정상：正常","readings":[{"term":"정상","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31752","senseId":"1","lemma":"정상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정상","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3"}},{"text":"영업을","meaning":"营业","explanation":"영업：营业；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영업","audio":"/audio/fb4c857393c312b799ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14084","senseId":"1","lemma":"영업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영업을","audio":"/audio/3118ff794af11ee6b67c.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"식당이","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당이","audio":"/audio/7fb3ef89763c2688893b.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"某种","explanation":"하나：某种","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"5","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}},{"text":"거기","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里","reading